                                                    <TextBlock Style="{DynamicResource StyledSecondaryTextBlock}"
                                                               Text="Projections only reflect transactions currently in the system. Imported bank files only include posted transactions, so recent external payments (like wiping a credit card balance) won't show up immediately. Until those transactions import, the planner may suggest paying off debt you've already cleared. Ensure your accounts are fully up to date to see accurate investment vs. debt payoff suggestions."
